  {"label":"A","audio":"Original_Course/105c Drag A (ms).mp3","story":[[0,"s","Okay, welcome to mini story A for drag."],[6.7,"s","In this mini story, I will ask questions you know."],[15,"s","Look at the text, you can find the answers."],[22.1,"s","Let's start."],[23.7,"s","Mom is a drag on the family business."],[30,"q","Who is a drag on the family business?"],[37.2,"a","Well, mom, right?"],[39.9,"s","The mom is a drag on the family business."],[48,"q","Is the dad a drag on the family business?"],[56,"a","No, not the dad."],[58.9,"s","The dad isn't a drag on the family business."],[65.5,"s","The mom is a drag on the family business."],[72,"q","Is the mom a drag or is the dad a drag?"],[80,"a","All right, the mom."],[82.5,"s","The mom is a drag on the family business."],[88.3,"s","The dad isn't a drag on the family business."],[94,"q","Who is a drag on the family business?"],[100,"a","That's right, the mom."],[103.7,"s","The mom is a drag on the family business."],[111.9,"q","When was the mom a drag on the family business?"],[121,"a","Well, the mom was a drag on the family business for many years."],[131,"s","For many years, right?"],[134.5,"s","Starting 20 years ago."],[138,"s","Starting 20 years ago until now."],[143.3,"q","All right, when did the daughters buy the business?"],[152,"a","20 years ago."],[155,"s","The daughters bought the business 20 years ago."],[162.8,"q","Who did they buy the business from?"],[168.7,"a","Ah, their mother."],[171.2,"s","They bought the business from their mother."],[177,"q","Did they buy the business from George Bush?"],[185,"a","No, they didn't buy the business from George Bush."],[191.8,"s","They bought the business from their mother."],[197,"q","Did they buy the business from their father?"],[202.2,"a","No, they didn't buy the business from their father."],[208,"s","They bought the business from their mother."],[215.5,"q","How long ago did they buy the business?"],[224,"a","20 years ago, right?"],[226.3,"s","20 years ago, they bought the business from their mother."],[232,"s","All right, very good."],[235.2,"q","Do they love their mother?"],[239.2,"a","Of course, they love their mother."],[244,"q","Do they respect their mother?"],[247.3,"a","Yes, of course, they respect their mother."],[252,"q","Does their mother respect them?"],[256.5,"a","Yes, their mother respects them."],[262.9,"q","Do they all respect each other?"],[270.5,"a","That's right, they all respect each other."],[278,"s","Mom respects them."],[281,"s","They respect mom."],[284,"q","All right, when will they finish paying off the business?"],[292.2,"a","Ah, in two years."],[295.3,"s","In two years, they will finish paying off the business."],[303.5,"q","Who will finish paying off the business?"],[309.6,"a","The sisters or the daughters will finish paying off the business."],[320,"q","When will the daughters finish paying off the business?"],[329,"a","In two years."],[331.6,"q","Who will finish paying off the business in two years?"],[340.3,"a","The daughters or sisters will finish paying off the business in two years."],[350,"q","Will the father finish paying off the business in two years?"],[356.1,"a","No, no, not the father."],[358.9,"s","The father will not finish paying off the business in two years."],[366.3,"s","The daughters will finish paying off the business in two years."],[376.1,"s","But the daughters have a problem."],[383.4,"s","Mom, who is 77, still gets money."],[392,"q","Who still gets money from the daughters?"],[397.7,"a","Mom, right?"],[399.3,"s","Mom still gets money from the daughters."],[405,"q","Does mom still get money from her daughters?"],[411.6,"a","That's right, mom still gets money from her daughters."],[419,"q","Does mom get a salary from her daughters?"],[424.3,"a","Yeah, that's right, she gets a salary, maybe per hour, from her daughters."],[434.5,"q","Does mom get a salary or does mom work for free?"],[447.3,"a","Mom gets a salary."],[452,"s","She doesn't work for free."],[455.4,"s","Mom gets a salary."],[458.2,"s","She still gets a salary."],[461.6,"q","Does mom also get money for the business?"],[467.6,"a","That's right, mom also gets money to pay for the business."],[477,"q","Who pays mom money for the business?"],[482.7,"a","Well, the daughters pay mom money for the business."],[490,"q","Who pays mom a salary?"],[493.9,"a","The daughters again."],[496.2,"s","The daughters pay mom a salary and the daughters pay money for the business."],[508,"q","How old is the mom?"],[513,"a","She is 77."],[516,"q","Is the mom very young?"],[521,"a","No, not really."],[523.4,"s","The mom is 77."],[526.5,"s","She's not very young."],[529.6,"q","Is she old?"],[532,"a","Well, not too old, but yeah, she is a little old."],[538.3,"s","She is 77."],[540,"s","Okay."],[540.8,"q","Does mom do a lot of work?"],[546.5,"a","No, she doesn't do a lot of work."],[553,"q","Does she do personal work on the clock?"],[560,"a","Yes, she does."],[563,"s","She does personal work on the clock."],[570,"q","Does mom read on the clock?"],[575.4,"a","She does."],[576.9,"s","Mom reads on the clock."],[580.9,"s","She reads during work time."],[584.8,"q","Does mom write letters on the clock?"],[590.6,"a","Yes, she does."],[593.2,"s","Mom writes letters on the clock during work time."],[601,"q","Who writes letters on the clock?"],[606.3,"a","Well, mom."],[608.1,"s","The mom writes letters on the clock."],[614.3,"q","Do the daughters pay mom to write letters?"],[621.7,"a","Well, they do pay her to write letters, but they don't want to."],[634,"q","Does mom write letters on the clock or does mom work very hard on the clock?"],[647.5,"a","Mom writes letters on the clock."],[652.8,"s","She doesn't work very hard on the clock."],[660.3,"q","Is mom's salary expensive for the daughters?"],[667.2,"a","Yes, mom's salary is expensive for the daughters."],[675.7,"q","Whose salary is expensive for the daughters?"],[683.2,"a","Mom's."],[684.3,"s","Mom's salary is expensive for the daughters."],[691.8,"q","What is expensive for the daughters?"],[697.8,"a","Mom's salary, right?"],[700.5,"s","Mom's salary is expensive for the daughters."],[707,"q","Is dad's salary expensive for the daughters?"],[713.1,"a","No, no."],[714.8,"s","Dad's salary isn't expensive for the daughters."],[720.9,"s","Mom's salary is expensive for the daughters."],[727.4,"q","Is mom's salary expensive for the daughters or cheap for the daughters?"],[737.3,"a","Well, her salary is expensive for the daughters."],[743,"s","It's not cheap for the daughters."],[749,"q","Are business expenses going up or going down?"],[757,"a","Business expenses are going up."],[761.6,"q","Are business expenses going up fast?"],[767.2,"a","Yes, yes, business expenses are going up fast."],[774.3,"q","Are business expenses going through the roof?"],[780.4,"a","Yes, business expenses are going through the roof."],[787.4,"s","They are going up very fast."],[792.7,"q","What is going up very fast?"],[798,"a","Business expenses."],[799.8,"s","Business expenses are going up very fast."],[806.3,"q","Whose business expenses are going up very fast?"],[812.7,"a","The daughters, right?"],[814.9,"s","The daughters' business expenses are going up very fast."],[821.8,"q","Are Bill Gates' business expenses going up very fast?"],[829.6,"a","No, no, not Bill Gates."],[834,"s","Bill Gates' business expenses aren't going up very fast."],[839.5,"s","The daughters' business expenses are going up very fast."],[847,"s","Why are the daughters' business expenses going up very fast?"],[857,"q","Why?"],[858,"a","Oh, because they must pay their mom two times."],[865.1,"s","They must pay her a salary and also they must pay her for the business."],[878.4,"q","So, why are their expenses going up fast?"],[887,"a","Because they must pay their mom two times."],[893.8,"q","Are their expenses going down?"],[898,"a","No, they're not."],[900.3,"s","Their expenses are not going down."],[904.9,"s","They are going up."],[907.9,"q","Do the daughters like this situation?"],[912.7,"a","No, they don't."],[915.3,"s","The daughters don't like this situation."],[920.5,"s","Okay, that is all for mini story A."],[925.7,"s","Listen to it many times."],[927.8,"s","Listen to it every day."],[929.9,"s","Listen to it when you're for two weeks or more."]]},
  {"label":"B","audio":"Original_Course/105c Drag B (ms).mp3","story":[[0,"s","Hello, welcome to Mini-Story B for drag."],[10,"s","In this mini-story lesson, I will ask two kinds of questions."],[20,"s","I will ask information you know."],[25,"s","And I will ask information you don't know."],[34,"s","If you don't know, guess."],[40.3,"s","Let's get started."],[44,"s","Twenty years ago, the sisters or daughters bought a business from their mother."],[60,"q","Did they buy a business from their mother?"],[68,"a","Yes, they did."],[70.1,"q","Who bought a business from their mother?"],[75,"a","The daughters."],[78,"s","What were their names?"],[84,"q","Were their names Sam and Olivia?"],[92,"a","Yes, that's right."],[94.7,"s","The daughters' names were Sam and Olivia."],[101,"q","What did Sam and Olivia buy?"],[108,"a","They bought a business."],[114,"q","When did they buy a business?"],[121,"a","Twenty years ago, they bought a business."],[128,"s","Where did they buy a business?"],[133,"s","Where did they buy a business?"],[139,"q","Did they buy a business in California?"],[145,"a","No."],[146.1,"q","Did they buy a business in Texas?"],[154,"a","No."],[155,"q","Did they buy a business in Canada?"],[162,"a","Yes, that's right."],[165,"s","They bought a business in Canada."],[171,"s","What kind of business did they buy?"],[180,"q","Did they buy a farm?"],[184,"a","No."],[186,"q","Did they buy a paper-making business?"],[194,"a","No, they didn't."],[196.3,"s","They didn't buy a paper-making business."],[201,"q","Did they buy a dog-cleaning business?"],[209,"a","Yes, that's right."],[211.7,"s","They bought a dog-cleaning business from their mother."],[219,"q","When did they buy a dog-cleaning business from their mother?"],[227,"a","Oh, you know."],[228.9,"s","Twenty years ago, they bought a dog-cleaning business from their mother."],[236,"q","Where did they buy the dog-cleaning business?"],[243,"a","In Canada."],[245,"s","They bought the dog-cleaning business from their mother in Canada."],[255,"s","How did they buy the business?"],[262,"q","How did they buy the business?"],[267,"a","They bought the business with gold."],[272,"s","G-O-L-D, gold."],[276,"s","They bought the business with gold from their mother in Canada."],[285,"q","What kind of business did they buy with gold?"],[293,"a","They bought a dog-cleaning business with gold from their mother."],[302,"s","Did they buy a cat-cleaning business from their mother?"],[309,"q","Or a dog-cleaning business from their mother?"],[314,"a","Ah, they bought a dog-cleaning business from their mother."],[323,"s","Okay, how much gold did they pay to buy the dog-cleaning business?"],[336,"q","Did they pay ten pounds of gold every year?"],[343,"a","No, they didn't pay ten pounds of gold every year."],[350,"q","Did they pay five hundred pounds of gold every year?"],[356,"a","Well, almost."],[357.5,"s","They paid five hundred and five pounds of gold every year."],[366,"q","Who did they pay five hundred and five pounds of gold to?"],[377,"a","Ah, to their mother, right?"],[380,"s","They paid five hundred and five pounds of gold every year to their mother."],[389,"q","Okay, how many times did they pay their mother?"],[398,"a","Well, they paid their mother every year."],[403,"s","Every year, they paid their mother five hundred and five pounds of gold."],[413,"q","Every year, did they pay their mother five hundred and six pounds of gold?"],[423,"a","No, every year, they paid their mother five hundred and five pounds of gold."],[433,"q","Why did they pay their mother five hundred and five pounds of gold every year?"],[445,"a","Well, because they bought her business."],[450,"q","What kind of business did they buy?"],[455,"a","A dog-cleaning business."],[458.4,"s","They bought a dog-cleaning business."],[464,"q","Did the mom continue to help with the dog-cleaning business?"],[474,"a","Yes, the mom continued to help with the dog-cleaning business."],[482,"q","Who did she continue to help?"],[488,"a","Well, she continued to help Sam and Olivia, her daughters."],[499,"q","Did she continue to help Sam and Olivia?"],[506,"a","Yeah, she continued to help Sam and Olivia."],[512,"q","Where did she help them?"],[516,"a","Well, she helped them at the business, at work."],[523,"q","Where was the business?"],[526,"a","In Canada."],[528,"s","She helped them at the business in Canada."],[534,"s","How did the mom help Sam and Olivia?"],[541,"s","How did she help them?"],[545,"s","Did she wash the dogs?"],[550,"q","Did she clean, did she wash the dogs?"],[555,"a","No, no, she didn't wash the dogs."],[561,"q","Why didn't she help wash the dogs?"],[565,"a","Well, because she was too old."],[570,"s","She was too old to wash the dogs."],[576,"q","Was she too old to use the computer?"],[584,"a","No, she wasn't too old to use the computer."],[589,"s","She was too old to wash the dogs."],[594,"q","Was she too old to wash all of the dogs?"],[602,"a","No, no, she wasn't too old to wash all of the dogs."],[610,"s","Which dogs was she too old to wash?"],[617,"q","Was she too old to wash the big dogs or the little dogs?"],[626,"a","Oh, she was too old to wash the little dogs."],[632,"s","Yeah, she was too old to wash the little dogs."],[638,"s","Hmm, why?"],[640,"q","Why was she too old to wash the little dogs?"],[646,"a","Oh, because they are fast."],[649,"s","The little dogs are very fast."],[653,"s","The little dogs are very fast, so mom was too old to wash the little dogs."],[662,"s","Mom only washed the big dogs."],[667,"q","Why did she only wash the big dogs?"],[673,"a","Well, obviously, because they were slow."],[679,"s","The big dogs were very slow, but the little dogs were too fast."],[687,"s","Mom only washed the big dogs."],[692,"s","How many big dogs did she wash every day?"],[698,"s","Did she wash one big dog every day?"],[703,"q","500 big dogs every day?"],[709,"a","No, she washed half a big dog every day."],[717,"q","Who washed only half a big dog every day?"],[726,"a","Mom, the mom."],[727,"q","What did the mom wash every day?"],[734,"a","The mom washed half a big dog every day."],[741,"q","When did she wash half a dog every day?"],[749,"a","Oh, well, at midnight, at midnight."],[754,"s","Only at midnight, she washed half a big dog every day."],[761,"s","Actually, every night."],[765,"q","Where did she wash half a big dog?"],[770,"a","Oh, in Canada, right?"],[772,"s","At the business in Canada."],[776,"q","How did she wash half a big dog?"],[783,"a","Well, she washed half a big dog with a toothbrush."],[789,"s","You know, brush your teeth."],[792,"s","She washed half a big dog with a toothbrush."],[798,"s","T-O-O-T-H-B-R-U-S-H She washed half a big dog every night at midnight with a toothbrush."],[815,"q","Why did she use a toothbrush?"],[821,"a","Oh, she used a toothbrush because her hands were very small."],[830,"s","Mom's hands were very small."],[835,"s","That's why she used a toothbrush."],[839,"q","Who used a toothbrush because her hands were small?"],[845,"a","The mom used a toothbrush because her hands were small."],[852,"q","What did the mom use to wash half a big dog?"],[861,"a","She used a toothbrush to wash half a big dog."],[868,"q","When did she use a toothbrush?"],[873,"a","At midnight."],[875,"s","At midnight, she used a toothbrush."],[879,"q","What did she use the toothbrush for?"],[887,"a","She used the toothbrush to wash half a big dog."],[897,"s","Okay, very good."],[899,"s","Now we understand more of the story."],[903,"s","Listen to this mini-story many, many times."],[908,"s","Listen every day."],[910,"s","Answer all the questions."],[914,"s","Use your pause button."],[917,"s","Listen to this story every day for two weeks, maybe three weeks, maybe ten weeks, but listen every day until you understand everything."],[933,"s","Okay, see you next time."],[936.3,"s","Bye-bye."]]}
]$j$::jsonb
where slug = 'drag';

